---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PROJECTS } from '../../data/projects';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="项目"
  description="邵敏峰的项目：AI HOT 每日晨报、企业 AI 平台。每个项目都有在线 Demo 或完整案例，更多项目正在构建。"
>
  <div class="shell page-hero">
    <p class="label">Projects / 2023—2026</p>
    <h1>项目</h1>
    <p>
      做过的东西，能在线点的都在这里。两个已上线，一个内部案例，更多正在构建。
      每一个都从真实问题出发，也尽量留下可以复用的方法。
    </p>
    <div class="page-meta">
      <span>{PROJECTS.length} 个项目</span>
      <span>1 个在线 Demo</span>
      <span>1 个内部案例（脱敏）</span>
      <span>更多在构建</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="shell section">
    <div class="work-list">
      {PROJECTS.map((project) => (
        <article class="work-feature">
          <div class="wf-copy">
            <span class="project-index">Project {project.index} / {project.year} · {project.status}</span>
            <h2 class="wf-title"><a href={'/work/' + project.slug + '/'}>{project.title}</a></h2>
            <p class="wf-tagline">{project.tagline}</p>
            <p class="wf-desc">{project.description}</p>
            <div class="wf-metrics">
              {project.metrics.slice(0, 3).map((metric) => (
                <div><strong>{metric.value}</strong><span>{metric.label}</span></div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="wf-links">
              {project.demo && (
                <a class="text-link" href={project.demo} target={project.demo.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : undefined} rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  {project.demoLabel} ↗
                </a>
              )}
              <a class="text-link" href={'/work/' + project.slug + '/'}>项目详情 →</a>
              {project.repo && <a class="text-link" href={project.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>}
            </div>
          </div>
          <a class="wf-media" href={'/work/' + project.slug + '/'} aria-label={'查看项目：' + project.title}>
            {project.cover ? (
              <img src={project.cover} alt={project.coverAlt} loading="lazy" />
            ) : (
              <div class="metric-cover" aria-hidden="true">
                {project.metrics.map((metric) => (
                  <div><strong>{metric.value}</strong><span>{metric.label}</span></div>
                ))}
              </div>
            )}
            <span class="media-caption">{project.coverCaption ?? project.en}</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section" id="building">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head-left">
        <span class="section-index">02</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">正在构建</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="section-note">Roadmap</span>
    </div>

    <div class="future-grid">
      <div class="future-card">
        <span class="future-num">01</span>
        <h3>MCP 工具集</h3>
        <p>把内部系统接进 Agent 的可复用工具层。从认证、权限到审计，做成可以安装的组件。</p>
        <span class="tag">探索中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="future-card">
        <span class="future-num">02</span>
        <h3>Agent 工作流</h3>
        <p>从任务拆解、执行到验收的工程化模板。目标不是更炫的 Demo，而是可回滚的生产流程。</p>
        <span class="tag">设计中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="future-card">
        <span class="future-num">03</span>
        <h3>开发者效率实验</h3>
        <p>用更小的工具缩短反馈回路：一个脚本、一个页面，或者一个下午能做完的东西。</p>
        <span class="tag">持续</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-foot">
      <span>想一起做点什么？或者你有一个值得被做出来的想法。</span>
      <a class="text-link" href={'mailto:' + SITE.email}>聊聊 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
